      "text": "2^3.5 = 2^3 + 0.5 = 2^3 x 2^0.5 = 8 . sqrt(2)\n= 2^0.5 = sqrt(2) = 2^3.5 = 8, 1.414 = 11.312",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
