      "text": "8 x (1 + 0.4 + 0.014) = (8 x1) + (8x0.4) + (8x0.014)\n8\n8 x 0.4 = 3.3\n8 x 0.014 = 0.112\n8 + 3.2 + 0.112 = 11.312",
